  "bottom_line": "Home Depot house brand. Lowest-density particleboard. Generic hinges (30K cycles). Generic drawer slides (25K cycles, 50 lb). Thermofoil or melamine finish. No soft-close. Multi-source import manufacturing. Pros universally refuse for quality installs. Reported 5-7 year total failure. Reduced from Timberlake Origins (52) to Hampton Bay (45) as true builder-grade floor based on new research.",
